@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 登录：用于创建项目和 API Token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 创建项目
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "备份示例"
}

### 创建 API Token
# @name createToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "backup agent"
}

### 上传备份：重复执行会为同一文件新增版本
# @name backup
POST {{baseUrl}}/backups
Authorization: Bearer {{createToken.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RewindBackupBoundary

--RewindBackupBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="project_id"

{{createProject.response.body.$.data.id}}
--RewindBackupBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="key"

docs/PRD.md
--RewindBackupBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

PRD 备份
--RewindBackupBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="PRD.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../../docs/PRD.md
--RewindBackupBoundary--

### 查询历史：最新版本排在最前
POST {{baseUrl}}/backups/history
Authorization: Bearer {{createToken.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project_id": "{{createProject.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "key": "docs/PRD.md",
  "page": 1,
  "page_size": 20
}

### 下载上传的版本：也可以使用登录 Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/backups/download/{{createProject.response.body.$.data.id}}/{{backup.response.body.$.data.version_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 使用登录 Token 上传（预期 UNAUTHORIZED）
POST {{baseUrl}}/backups
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 删除 API Token：之后上传预期 UNAUTHORIZED
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tokens/{{createToken.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 删除项目及其全部备份文件
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
